    "The template is a scaffold. It gives you what Coherence and Cohesion asks for at Band 7: paragraphing, <em>\"a clear central topic within each paragraph\"</em>, and progression. The <strong>B2 tier</strong> (the Band 7 track) uses plain frames. The <strong>C1 tier</strong> (the Band 8 track) uses academic English.",
