    "A <strong>two-part</strong> prompt asks two questions: <em>\"Why has this happened? Is it a positive or a negative development?\"</em> Body A answers question one. Body B answers question two. Give them equal weight.",
    "Start with <em>\"In answer to the first question, …\"</em> and <em>\"Turning to the second question, …\"</em>. One sentence is not an answer. Do not change it into advantages or a solution.",
